The new Cris Taxi Bucuresti app offers:
- order a taxi with just two taps;
- the opportunity of calculating the trip’s route and estimated cost, having entered the destination;
- the possibility of ordering a taxi without gps tracking, using the address search engine;
- showing points of interest around the location;
- details about the driver and the taxi vehicle;
- the possibility to communicate by phone with the driver or with the taxi dispatcher;
- client-driver messages;
Cris Taxi Bucharest is proud of a bright and long tradition in the field of passenger transport (taxi) since 1992.
Our taxi services fully cover both Bucharest and the surrounding areas.
Cris Taxi Bucharest has a fleet of 1000 cars (Skoda Octavia, Renault Clio, Dacia Logan).
Among the services offered by CrisTaxi Bucharest you will find a modern taxi dispatcher, based on online and telephone orders

GAL trans is a Moldovan carrier company that operates regular bus services from Moldova to Romania, Ukraine and Russia.

With the application from GAL Trans you can easily:
– choose a flight suitable for the requested date;
– check buses routes on the map;
– see buses’ photos;
– make a reservation with payment to the driver during the boarding;
– pay for the ticket online;
– get access to the history of all purchased tickets in the personal account
– make a quick ticket return in your personal account
– request information from support service.

GAL Trans has a large bus fleet that meets European standards.

The professional drivers team will make sure that your trip is as comfortable as possible.

GAL Trans - it's important, who you travel with!

Explore Siyam World and its stunning facilities, plan your visit and activities from your device before and during your visit. Use this app to start planning your stay, and ensure you don’t miss-out on any of the incredible experiences on offer at Siyam World Maldives. During your stay the app provides the perfect travel companion, showing what’s on, providing you with fantastic inspiration from the recommended bucket list experiences which you can book directly from the app.  Your itinerary is always accessible to see what adventures you have planned.  
A personal concierge in your pocket!
About the Resort:
Siyam World is a striking new vision of the Maldives’ rich natural wonders, a carefree playground with an exciting, diverse, and endless array of ‘never-seen-before’ experiences to bask in a WOW! Premium All-Inclusive island getaway that crosses cultures and borders. Designed for fun-loving, open-minded couples, romance seekers, families or larger groups of friends, with the freedom to roam, socialise and engage in an island community. Siyam World is one of the largest islands in the Maldives to boast a resort and show-stopping residences - The Beach House Collection.


Use the app to help:
- Explore the services and facilities available at the resort;
- Perfect your stay by booking restaurant tables, excursions and activities such as snorkelling, scuba diving or spa treatments;
- view the entertainment schedule for the upcoming week;
- request to book any special events that you’d like to arrange for a loved one;
- book your next stay at the resort.

The new TaxiClub application will help you book a taxi all over Moldova. A user-friendly application interface will help you easily place an order. It is designed for users of all ages to help them get the right information in any kind of situations. Get rid of the waste of time for explanations, where to meet you and where the destination point is. Just use one of the currently available options:
- address selection from the built-in catalog;
- search for the address on the Google Maps or/and Yandex Maps;
- book a car by pointing on the map.
Get permanent updates regarding  your order on the smartphone screen:
- distance from the start address to the destination point;
- the preliminary cost of the order;
- current status of the order;
- data on the assigned car;
- final check of the trip.
If necessary, use the option to communicate with the driver directly from the application.
Your choice is important for us, so we strive to improve your comfort when using our taxi services. Try the mobile application to call a taxi and make sure each of our interactions will become even more convenient and pleasant.

Official mobile app of Sheremetyevo International Airport.

With this app the airport's passengers and visitors can:
- Get up-to-date flight information: check-in opening and closing times, check-in counters and boarding gates, baggage claim area, flight delays or cancellations;
- Find shops, restaurants, and infrastructure facilities on a map of the airport;
- Order assistance for people with disabilities at the airport;
- Learn about promotions and special offers provided by shops and restaurants in the airport;
- Check transport routes and schedules to/from the airport;
- Study the rules of pre-flight and post-flight inspections, traveling with children, and checking in special baggage.

We look forward to your ratings and reviews!

INFOBUS is an application to search and purchase bus, train and plane tickets.

You can use INFOBUS for the following:
- book and buy tickets in just a few clicks without leaving home;
- check flight schedules online;
- always have tickets with you;
- automatically receive bonuses upon payment of a ticket.

Key Features:

Convenience - user-friendly interface;
Time saving – the application saves your time, so you could spend it on yourself :)
Efficiency – the ticket is immediately sent to your email upon payment;
Simplicity – easy-to-use search, booking and payment system;
Information content - the application contains up-to-date information on seats availability on flights, luggage transportation features, current prices and discounts, etc.;
Systematic updates – the application is constantly updated and supplemented with new information and features for the convenience of our customers.


We created this application to make your life easier.

